{{also|snow plow}}
==English==
[[File:Sneeuwschuiver.jpg|thumb|'''Snowplow''' removing snow from a road.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|snow plow}}
* {{l|en|snowplough}}, {{l|en|snow plough}} {{qualifier|Commonwealth}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|snow|plow}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}} {{tlb|en|American spelling}}

# A motorized [[vehicle]] that is used to push snow off flat surfaces such as roads and [[parking lot]]s.
# A device attached to a vehicle to enable it to be used for removing snow.
# {{lb|en|skiing|skating}} A [[maneuver]] in which the tips of the skis or skates point inwards and the back ends point outwards.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|snowplough model}}, {{l|en|snowplow model}}
* {{l|en|snowplough turn}}, {{l|en|snowplow turn}}
* {{l|en|snowplow parent}}, {{l|en|snowplow parenting}}

